  "Question": "What is the difference between \\(7^2\\) and 50?",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "-1",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Since \\(7^2=49\\), the answer depends on what “difference between” means. If it means the first quantity minus the second, then\n\\[\n7^2-50=49-50=-1,\n\\]\nwhich matches the supplied key. If it means the nonnegative difference, then \\(50-49=1\\). Thus \\(7^2<50\\), but the wording does not determine a unique numeric answer: it gives \\(-1\\) under the first interpretation and \\(1\\) under the second.",
